    "description": "Located in the desirable Outer Richmond District, this well-maintained 3+ unit apartment building presents an exceptional investment opportunity. Built in 1982 (per tax records), the property offers approximately 4,337 sqft of living space on a 2,500 sqft lot. The building consists of multiple spacious units, three of which are tenant-occupied with updated rental income, while the top-floor apartment is currently vacant, providing flexibility for an owner-occupant or additional rental upside. Situated in a highly walkable location, residents enjoy easy access to Lands End, Sea Cliff, Lincoln Park Golf Course, and the scenic coastal trails. Everyday conveniences, including schools, grocery stores, restaurants, hospitals, and public transportation, are all nearby, while downtown San Francisco and the Financial District are just minutes away.  With its prime location, strong income potential, and a mix of stability and upside, 7231-7233 Geary Boulevard is a compelling addition to any real estate portfolio."
